        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for libsoup2",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for libsoup2 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-1761: Check length of bytes read in soup_filter_input_stream_read_until to avoid a stack-based buffer\n  overflow (bsc#1257598).\n- CVE-2026-0716: improper bounds handling may allow out-of-bounds read (bsc#1256418).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
